  <h1>How to Estimate the Cost of Training a Frontier Model</h1>
  <p class="lead">Training a GPT-4 or Llama 3–class model from scratch costs roughly $100–150M end-to-end on cloud. Modern frontier reasoning models (GPT-o1/o3, Gemini 2.5 Pro, Qwen-3) add another $7–25M in RLVR post-training. This guide walks you through every step of the calculation — from the core <code>C = 6ND</code> formula to RLVR rollout/reward/gradient costs — using Llama 3 405B as a fully worked example.</p>
